---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { business } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="Recording policies and booking terms" description="Find the current Legacy Music Group recording terms and ask the studio about payment, cancellation, rescheduling and session requirements before booking."><div class="shell"><header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Legacy Music Group</p><h1>Read the details.<br /><em>Then make plans.</em></h1></header><article class="reading"><h2>One source for studio terms</h2><p>Legacy’s existing booking website links to its current recording terms. Review those terms before checkout and before arriving for a session.</p><h2>Questions to settle first</h2><p>Confirm payment, cancellation, rescheduling, guest limits, arrival timing and the files you need to bring. Ask the studio about anything your session depends on.</p><h2>No second policy</h2><p>This site does not introduce a separate deposit, refund or cancellation policy. A copied email brief is not a paid booking or a reservation.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href={business.termsUrl}>Read current recording terms ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Ask the studio</a></div></article></div></Layout>
